# Cloudflare Pages redirects/rewrites — clean URLs without ".html"
# https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/
#
# Order matters: 200 = internal rewrite (URL stays the same in the
# browser), 301 = permanent redirect. We rewrite extension-less paths
# to their .html files so links like `/admin/login` and `/admin/dashboard`
# work without the file extension.

/admin/login            /admin/login.html      200
/admin/dashboard        /admin/dashboard.html  200
/admin                  /admin/login.html      301
/admin/                 /admin/login.html      301
